{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2018WDF\u2019, Is a horizontal shmup game with a <strong>Boss-rush</strong> style in that the difficulty will increase slightly after the player clears all stages and continues to the next loop. Each loop will be different from the other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395970/extras/story.gif?t=1741031817\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Moon has awakened\u2014and it is hungry.</strong> No longer a cold rock in space, it radiates an unnatural fire, turning night into an extinction event. The world is burning. <strong>Humanity\u2019s last hope: an elite strike team sent to the Moon to uncover the cause and put an end to it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different types of players ship with different play styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand-drawn animation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A ton of enemy types including bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">online leaderboard</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The end","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3395970/66c3b14f705850340ce2e2adb2e57da0a12c98b7.jpg"},{"name":"1CC - A","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3395970/66c3b14f705850340ce2e2adb2e57da0a12c98b7.jpg"},{"name":"1CC - B","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3395970/66c3b14f705850340ce2e2adb2e57da0a12c98b7.jpg"},{"name":"The impossible [ 1CC - C ]","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3395970/66c3b14f705850340ce2e2adb2e57da0a12c98b7.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/ima